source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Local on-disk signed-artifact registry (not a live npm[PATH] service)

Usage: franken-node registry <COMMAND>

Commands:
  publish  Admit a signed artifact into the local on-disk registry (not npm[PATH] publish)
  search   Query locally stored registry artifacts with trust filters
  verify   Verify a locally stored registry artifact's hash and signature
  gc       Archive older locally stored registry artifacts, keeping the newest N active entries per lineage
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
